Dear list,

When not in X, I can change the throttling by echoing to
/proc/acpi/processor/CPU0/throttling.  However, as soon as I start X, the
throttling is reset to T0.  In X, no amount of echoing to the throttling
interface can change the throttling amount away from T0.

Does anyone have any ideas what could be causing this?

